 text-gray-400\">Memory</p>\n          <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">2.4 / 8 GB</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"h-full bg-emerald-500 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 30%\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"glass-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/10\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-amber-600/30 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-amber-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Disk Usage</p>\n          <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\">45 / 200 GB</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 h-2 bg-gray-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"h-full bg-amber-500 rounded-full\" style=\"width: 22%\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"glass-card rounded-xl p-4 border border-white/10\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n        <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-sky-600/30 flex items-center justify-center\">\n          <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-sky-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">Network<